\subsection{SmolVLA Pruning Ablation}
\label{sec:smolvla_ablation_setup}

We train a lightweight ACIS module (3.46M parameters, 0.77\% of SmolVLA) to predict per-token importance scores with VLA weights frozen. The ablation varies scoring (learned ACIS vs.\ random), retention ratio ($k \in \{0.50, 0.70, 0.90, 0.95\}$), and mechanism (zero-masking, true removal, token merging via ToMe~\cite{bolya2023tome}), yielding seven configurations.

